<title>BRAZIL: Brazil says B Band qualifier list still due June 4.</title>
<headline>Brazil says B Band qualifier list still due June 4.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil will release the names of qualified bidders on B Band cellular concessions at 0900 local/1200 gmt on Wednesday June 4, despite market rumors the release may be delayed, an official said.</p>
<p>&quot;As of one minute ago, that continues to be the schedule,&quot; a spokesman at the Communications Ministry said.</p>
<p>The names of the qualified consortia would be made public at ministry offices, he added.</p>
<p>((-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
